@startuml Merge Help Agent - Simplified Flow

title Merge Help Agent - Conflict Resolution Flow

skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor "GitHub" as GH #LightBlue
participant "Agent\nRunner" as Agent #LightGreen
participant "LLM\n(Claude/Gemini)" as LLM #Orange
participant "RAG\nPattern Store" as RAG #Pink
participant "Sandbox\n(Docker)" as Sandbox #Cyan

== PR Event Received ==

GH -> Agent : PR opened / updated
Agent --> GH : 202 Accepted (processing async)
Agent -> LLM : Start conflict resolution

== Analyze Conflict ==

LLM -> GH : Fetch branch info & file content
GH --> LLM : Files from both branches

LLM -> GH : Detect merge conflicts
GH --> LLM : List of conflicting files

== Search Past Resolutions ==

LLM -> RAG : Search for similar conflicts

alt Past patterns found
    RAG --> LLM : Similar resolutions (use as guidance)
else No patterns found
    RAG --> LLM : No matches — proceed with independent analysis
end

== Generate Resolution ==

LLM -> LLM : Analyze conflicts\nand generate resolution

== Validate ==

LLM -> Sandbox : Validate resolved code (compile/lint)

alt Validation passes
    Sandbox --> LLM : Code is valid
else Validation fails
    Sandbox --> LLM : Errors found
    LLM -> LLM : Read errors and fix code
    LLM -> Sandbox : Re-validate fixed code
    Sandbox --> LLM : Pass / Fail
end

== Commit & Learn ==

alt Resolution successful
    LLM -> GH : Create resolution branch
    LLM -> GH : Commit resolved files
    LLM -> RAG : Store resolution pattern\n(for future use)
    LLM -> GH : Comment on PR with analysis
    LLM -> Agent : Done
else Resolution failed after 2 attempts
    LLM -> LLM : Generate human review report\n(conflicts, attempts, errors, suggestions)
    LLM -> GH : Post escalation report on PR
    LLM -> Agent : Escalated to human
    note over GH #LIGHTYELLOW
      Human reviewer takes over
      with full diagnostic context
    end note
end

@enduml